# Smooth-first fallback if Memory Pressure yellows with m3-8gb.vmoptions (2560M).
# Filename is historical — this is NOT 3584M and NEVER 4096M. Cap stays ≤3G.
# Use only with everything else quit; drop further to -Xmx2G -Xms1G if still swapping.

-Xms1024M
-Xmx2048M
-XX:SoftMaxHeapSize=1536M
-XX:+UseZGC
-XX:+ZGenerational
-XX:+AlwaysPreTouch
-XX:+DisableExplicitGC
-XX:NmethodSweepActivity=1
-XX:+PerfDisableSharedMem
-Djava.awt.headless=true
